---
---

<section id="fitur" class="relative scroll-mt-20 py-24 sm:py-32 lg:py-40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
        Kemudahan di Setiap Tilawah.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg font-normal leading-relaxed text-slate-600 sm:text-xl">
        Dirancang tanpa distraksi agar Anda bisa langsung membaca di sela waktu luang.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Immersive Feature Showcase -->
    <div class="mt-16 sm:mt-20 space-y-8 sm:space-y-12">
      <!-- Feature 1: Full-Width Immersive Card - Lanjut dari Ayat Terakhir -->
      <div class="group overflow-hidden rounded-[32px] sm:rounded-[40px] border border-slate-200/70 bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 shadow-[0_20px_50px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] transition-all hover:shadow-lg">
        <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
          <div class="lg:col-span-5">
            <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">
              Lanjut Otomatis.
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600 sm:text-lg">
              Buka aplikasi dan langsung lanjutkan bacaan Anda seketika. Tanpa perlu mengingat nomor halaman atau repot menandai secara manual.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/60 shadow-sm lg:col-span-7">
            <img
              src="/images/feature-resume.jpg"
              alt="Membaca Al-Qur'an dengan tenang di mana saja"
              class="h-72 sm:h-96 w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2 & 3: Two Immersive Grid Cards -->
      <div class="grid gap-8 sm:gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <!-- Feature 2: Standar Sahih Kemenag RI -->
        <div id="kemenag" class="group flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-[32px] sm:rounded-[40px] border border-slate-200/70 bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-[0_20px_50px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] transition-all hover:shadow-lg">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">
              Standar Sahih Kemenag RI.
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
              Rasm Usmani resmi Kementerian Agama Republik Indonesia. Teks Arab jernih dan proporsional dengan panduan tajwid berwarna yang nyaman di mata.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/60 shadow-sm">
            <img
              src="/images/feature-kemenag.jpg"
              alt="Khat Rasm Usmani Mushaf Standar Kemenag RI"
              class="h-64 sm:h-80 w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 3: 100% Offline & Nol Iklan -->
        <div class="group flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-[32px] sm:rounded-[40px] border border-slate-200/70 bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-[0_20px_50px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] transition-all hover:shadow-lg">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">
              Nol Iklan. Bebas Kuota.
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
              Seluruh 30 juz tersimpan langsung di ponsel Anda. Membaca dengan tenang kapan pun tanpa kuota internet dan tanpa gangguan komersial.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/60 shadow-sm">
            <img
              src="/images/feature-offline.jpg"
              alt="Tilawah tenang tanpa koneksi internet dan bebas iklan"
              class="h-64 sm:h-80 w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
